{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diatonic is a rhythm roguelike where your piano becomes the controller. Connect a MIDI keyboard and play through dynamic levels that challenge your timing and accuracy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Randomized Runs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new songs by turning them into roguelike runs - sections of the song become different levels to make learning easier and more fun. Each run features randomized levels for a fresh experience every time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn Naturally</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to piano or experienced, Diatonic helps sharpen your piano skills. Play along with sheet music-style notes to naturally practice sight-reading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a real MIDI keyboard (any size!) for the most authentic experience. You can also use a computer keyboard, a controller, or the on-screen piano with mouse/touch controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 20+ songs included with game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load custom MIDI files to play your own songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice treble clef, bass clef, or both together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace: speed up or slow down the tempo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn with a mode that waits until you play the correct note</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports sharps, flats, and all key signatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978490?t=1763103134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978490?t=1763103134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/0ff57540b4f618f