n songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice treble clef, bass clef, or both together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace: speed up or slow down the tempo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn with a mode that waits until you play the correct note</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports sharps, flats, and all key signatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nonzero Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978490/5c0d7eced8b2c30648ba3f3a33e30181359a503c/header.jpg?t=1763103134","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11.7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3978490/158172177/7e7b84e1ac547e0d6470834f2333db275e6e101d/1763101198/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763103133","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3978490/158172177/7e7b84e1ac547e0d6470834f2333db275e6e101d/1763101198/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763103133","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3978490/158172177/7e7b84e1ac547e0d6470834f2333db275e6e101d/1763101198/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763103133","id":257228862,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228862/movie480.mp4?t=1763103133","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228862/movie_max.mp4?t=1763103133"},"name":"Short Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228862/38f329d4840ad5f0b74c